usage: run_mobile_manipulation_trials.py [-h] --mode
                                         {observe,arm_checks,fetch,e0,navigation}
                                         [--profile PROFILE]
                                         [--scene-config SCENE_CONFIG]
                                         --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
                                         [--sections {A1,A2,R,R_FAULTS} [{A1,A2,R,R_FAULTS} ...]]
                                         [--fault-config FAULT_CONFIG]
                                         [--seed SEED]
                                         [--task-kind {G,PLACE,C}]
                                         [--frozen-spec FROZEN_SPEC]
                                         [--simulation-config SIMULATION_CONFIG]

Single first-stage runner: diagnostics, formal fetch Goals and E0 records.
Start the protected Isaac scene and ROS stack separately. This runner never
publishes actuator commands, and never turns a controller receipt into
success.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --mode {observe,arm_checks,fetch,e0,navigation}
  --profile PROFILE
  --scene-config SCENE_CONFIG
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
  --sections {A1,A2,R,R_FAULTS} [{A1,A2,R,R_FAULTS} ...]
  --fault-config FAULT_CONFIG
                        Explicit owner-only local R07/R08 test configuration;
                        default disabled
  --seed SEED
  --task-kind {G,PLACE,C}
  --frozen-spec FROZEN_SPEC
  --simulation-config SIMULATION_CONFIG
                        Actual Isaac simulation_config.json; required for
                        navigation
